  m_text: 'It has been several weeks since the disappearance of numerous individuals.


    The
    authorities are still on the look out for any clues regarding this incident.


    So
    far they have come up with nothing.


    The only thing that was common was
    that they were taken some time in the afternoon where there was no witnesses
    to see the kidnapping.'
